# ...except the built dashboard, which IS the product and must ship in the
# wheel. It was gitignored by the blanket `dist/` above, so no distribution
# ever carried it (#862) and CI fell through to a vendored 2025-11-17 build
# (#864). Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so
# the directory is un-excluded first, then its contents re-excluded, then the
# one artifact re-included. `stats.html` stays ignored deliberately: the
# bundle-visualiser output embeds absolute build-machine paths.
!scripts/dashboard/dist/
scripts/dashboard/dist/*
!scripts/dashboard/dist/index.html
